{
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "Slingshot 的输入起点是 n×J 的归一化表达矩阵，并假设细胞已被划分为 K 个簇；你已提供 normalized_expression=present，但 cluster_labels=absent，因此缺少簇划分这一输入。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "We start from an n×J matrix of normalized expression measures (e.g., read counts) for n single cells and J genes or features. Slingshot assumes that the n cells have been partitioned into K clusters, potentially corresponding to distinct cellular states."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "降维不是硬性必要条件：原则上可以直接使用归一化表达，但强烈推荐在伪时间重建前先做降维，因为曲线拟合使用欧氏距离，在高维空间可能表现不佳。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "Although Slingshot can in principle be applied directly to the normalized expression measures, we strongly recommend a dimensionality reduction step before pseudotemporal reconstruction, as Slingshot’s curve-fitting step uses Euclidean (or related) distances, which can misbehave in high-dimensional spaces (cf. curse of dimensionality)."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你已提供 reduced_dimensions=present，满足这一推荐条件；但仅凭当前状态仍不能开始，因为缺少簇划分。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": [
        "user:reduced_dimensions"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "已知末端簇是可选的局部监督，不限制全局谱系数目；因此末端簇信息不是开始推断的必要条件。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 4,
          "quote": "Importantly, this type of local supervision does not prevent the discovery of novel lineages; it allows the incorporation of specific knowledge of cell clusters, without imposing restrictions on the global branching structure."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "提醒：论文版本还要求用户指定初始簇或根节点，但这是版本特定的说明，不能据此推断所有软件版本都必须显式传入根参数。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 7,
          "quote": "Like other methods (TSCAN, Waterfall, Monocle 2), Slingshot requires the user to identify the initial cluster or root node."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    }
  ],
  "clarification": {
    "question": "你是否有可用的细胞簇划分（cluster labels）？",
    "missing_field": "cluster_labels",
    "why_needed": "Slingshot 假设细胞已被划分为 K 个簇，缺少簇划分会直接影响能否开始轨迹推断。"
  }
}
